NOBODY’s perfect. People say things they don’t mean every single day. But is it intentional, or an honest mistake?

Because the older you get the more you realize which is which. With Family, friends & even Clients.

The difference now is I caught the cycle. The frequencies keep repeating once you start paying attention.

Words are cheap. 

Doing what you said you’d do is the whole flex.

